fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gststructure.html#gst_structure_new_id_str_valist","fragment":"\n\tgst_structure_new_id_str_valist\n\nCreates a new GstStructure with the given name.  Structure fields\nare set according to the varargs in a manner similar to\ngst_structure_new_id_str.\nFree-function: gst_structure_free\nParameters:\nname of new structure\nname of first field to set\nvariable argument list\na new GstStructure\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});